{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the challenge of constructing and optimizing the production line for the world's most powerful rocket, Starship. As the manager of your own Starbase, you\u2019ll build the factory, tank farm, launch mounts, and vehicles necessary for the colonization of Mars!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Factory:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform an empty plot into a bustling hub of productivity with cutting-edge technology. Optimize your factory to accelerate the production of ships required for the journey to Mars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940340/extras/04bda769277649d6e5cec2aff0233a9d.poster.avif?t=1737726718\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940340/extras/04bda769277649d6e5cec2aff0233a9d.webm?t=1737726718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940340/extras/04bda769277649d6e5cec2aff0233a9d.mp4?t=1737726718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test, Launch, Iterate:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is unforgiving, and it\u2019s up to you to create vehicles resilient enough to withstand the rigors of spaceflight. Put your creations to the test at the launch site, utilizing telemetry and cameras to track their progress. Refine your factory design based on real-time feedback to achieve flawless flights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940340/extras/e34099a7ee048d209dbe4d6d9bd24bcb.poster.avif?t=1737726718\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940340/extras/e34099a7ee048d209dbe4d6d9bd24bcb.webm?t=1737726718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940340/extras/e34099a7ee048d209dbe4d6d9bd24bcb.mp4?t=1737726718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Existing Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile factory and launch site construction enabling countless layouts and configurations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive inventory of resources, propellants, and vehicle components for assembly and management</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine fully functional vehicles, each with their own test campaigns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten distinct test scenarios, from propellant load to 200-meter hops and 10-kilometer belly-flop landings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roadmap:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbital Launches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OLT Catches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2940340?t=1737726718","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2940340?t=1737726718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940340/bcee8451b2ae1a95531465201eb1275f1d599b54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737726718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940340/bcee8451b2ae1a95531465201eb1275f1d599b54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737726718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p c